OL,3,GNEWSAEast needs 30,000 more workers for
OL,4,Amajor projects - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe east of England is facing a major
OL,7,Flabour shortage which could mean
OL,8,Fconstruction projects like Sizewell C,
OL,9,FUniversal and the Lower Thames Crossing
OL,10,Fare delayed and become more expensive,
OL,11,Fpoliticians have said.
OL,13,FA study by a group of local MPs and
OL,14,Fcouncillors has concluded that
OL,15,Femployers need to recruit 30,000 new
OL,16,Fworkers over the next five years if
OL,17,Fmore than 50 big projects are to be
OL,18,Fdelivered on time.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
