OL,3,GNEWSAEast needs 30,000 more workers for
OL,4,Amajor projects - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey say the goal can be achieved if
OL,7,Fthere is more government funding for
OL,8,Ftraining courses and better
OL,9,Fco-ordinated working between industry
OL,10,Fand local colleges.
OL,12,FThe minister for growth says delivering
OL,13,Finfrastructure in the east is important
OL,14,Fand he wants to help unblock projects
OL,15,Fwhich are facing challenges.
